<title>UK: Courtaulds 1st-half profit falls 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds 1st-half profit falls 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.6		   vs 11.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.45		   vs 4.3</p>
<p> Pretax		     64.0		   vs 67.8</p>
<p> Turnover (billion stg) 1.07		   vs 1.15</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 65 to 70 million stg.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 80.2		   vs 85.6</p>
<p> Interest paid	    16.3		   vs 17.9</p>
<p> Tax			  16.1		   vs 14.6</p>
<p> Net taxed		  47.9		   vs 53.2</p>
<p> Attributable	     43.2		   vs 45.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 20, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  December 10</p>
<p> Ex-div date		December 2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
